---
title: Company Information
description: Set up your company details, logo, and branding in FOSSBilling.
---

Enter your business details once so they appear consistently across invoices, emails, hosted pages, and client-facing documents.

## Where to Configure It

**Configuration → Settings → SYSTEM**

![Company settings location](../../../assets/company-info.gif)

## Company Logo

Upload the logo assets FOSSBilling should use across the interface:

- **Light mode logo** — Primary logo for light backgrounds
- **Dark mode logo** — Alternate logo for dark backgrounds, if your theme needs one

### Best Practices

- Store logos in your theme's `assets/` folder
- Use SVG for crisp display at any size
- Keep file sizes reasonable (< 500KB)

{% aside type="caution" %}
Don't edit `themes/huraga/assets/img/logo.svg` directly — it's overwritten on updates. Upload your logo through the settings page instead.
{% /aside %}

### Logo Not Showing?

1. Clear FOSSBilling cache: **System → Tools → Clear cache**
2. Clear your browser cache
3. Check the file path is correct

## Other Company Details

Configure the rest of your business profile in the same area:

| Setting | Where It Appears |
|---------|------------------|
| Company name | Invoices, emails, PDFs, client area |
| Address | Invoice PDFs, company profile |
| Email | System emails, contact forms |
| Phone | Client area, invoices |
| VAT/Tax ID | Invoice PDFs, tax calculations |
| Terms of Service | Checkout page, client agreements |

## Email Signature

Set the default signature appended to system emails:

```
--
Best regards,
The Example Company Team
https://example.com
```

This signature appears at the bottom of most automated emails. You can still override it in individual templates.

For more control over generated output, see [Email Templates](/customizing-fossbilling/email-templates/) and [Customizing Invoice PDFs](/customizing-fossbilling/invoice-pdf/).

## Currency Settings

Also in **Configuration → Settings → Currency**:

- Default currency
- Currency format
- Exchange rate sources

See [Currency Support](/faq/features/#currency-support) for more.
